From: DroidDeck
Subject: [PATCH] main: opt-in Vulkan enumeration without renderer/backend initialization

Gamescope 3.16.29. Use only core instance queries at API 1.0 through the normal
Vulkan loader. No logical device or WSI/backend is initialized in this mode.

